  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till ett utbildningsprogram inom ramen f&#xF6;r projektet Nordpraktik d&#xE4;r unga f&#xF6;retagsanst&#xE4;llda fr&#xE5;n Baltikum g&#xF6;r praktik i Sverige. Utbildningsprogrammet som &#xE4;r ett komplement till praktiken omfattar bl. a f&#xF6;retagsekonomi, ledarskap och statskunskap/historia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of an educational programme during the stay of 21 trainees from the Baltic States at swedish enterprises. The participants will attend courses in political science, buisness economy and management in a Swedish perspective.</narrative>
  </description>
